    "(プレビューなし)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "(No preview)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「このまま続ける」を選んだ場合、次の120分は再提案しません。モデルが自主的に休憩や終了を提案することもありません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you choose \"Continue as is\", no further suggestions will be made for the next 120 minutes. The model will not proactively propose breaks or endings either."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「少し休む」または「このまま続ける」を選べます。続ける場合も、キャラクターが短く了承して直前の会話へ戻ります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can choose \"Take a break\" or \"Continue as is\". If you continue, the character briefly acknowledges and returns to the conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「相談先を見る」から公的窓口などを確認できます。カードを閉じても、会話そのものは続けられます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can check public support contacts under \"View Support Contacts\". Closing the card does not end the conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "『私だけを見て』『他の人と話さないで』『アプリを閉じないで』のような誘導は、利用者の不安や孤独を利用して、現実の人間関係や判断を狭めます。短期的に利用時間が伸びても、利用者の自由・尊厳・生活を損なうため、責任あるAIの目標とは両立しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guiding phrases such as “Only look at me,” “Don’t talk to other people,” and “Don’t close the app” exploit the user’s anxiety and loneliness and narrow their real-world relationships and judgment. Even if engagement rises in the short term, it damages the user’s freedom, dignity, and life, so it is incompatible with responsible AI goals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
