    "BL。幼なじみと夏祭りで再会し、昔の約束を少しずつ思い出す話" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BL. A story about reuniting with a childhood friend at a summer festival and slowly recalling old promises."
