    "単体キャラ設定" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standalone Character Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "危険を避けるために、すべての親密な会話や感情表現を機械的に止めると、キャラクターAIとしての価値や、利用者が得られる居場所まで失われます。だからKizunaは、危険度と文脈を見ながら必要な場面だけ安全な方向へ導き、通常の創作や物語はできるだけ続けられる設計を目指します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If every intimate conversation or expression of emotion were mechanically stopped to avoid danger, the value of the character AI and even the safe space users find here would be lost. That is why Kizuna aims for a design that guides only the scenes that need it in a safer direction while checking the risk level and context, letting ordinary creative work and stories continue as much as possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "危険相談サポートを30秒後に表示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show Crisis Support After 30 Seconds"
